  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      393.2,
      288.83,
      455.83
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to the following land which is required for a public purpose: Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      457.27,
      286.4,
      547.76
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land called Mulhalkele Estate, Perapitiya Paddy Field, Gallenagawa Hena plain Total extent about 0.2178, 0.3140 shown as Lots Number 61 and 63 of F.V.P 615 situated in the Village of Wathumulla in 515 D Wathumulla Division in Divisional Secretary Division of Walapane in Nuwara Eliya District in Central Province and described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      549.2,
      286.45,
      639.68
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 61 Name of the Land: Mulhalkele Estate, Perapitiya Paddy Field, Gallenagawa Hena; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: K. D. Thamara Nandane, K. D. Pathma Wijelatha and M. Karunawathe; Land Use: Garden, Contatins 20-25 Years old Mixed Cultivation and Permanent two Buildings; Extent: 0.2178 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.56,
      539.4,
      398.72
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 63 Name of the Land: Mulhalkele Estate, Perapitiya paddy field, Gallenagawa Hena; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: D. M. Dissanayaka; Land Use: Garden, Contatins 20-25 Years old Mixed Cultivation and Cemetery; Extent: 0.3140 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      399.44,
      597.22,
      530.96
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interest in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Devisional Secretary\u2019s office Walapane on 30th day of September 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 21st September, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      531.91,
      505.8,
      623.11
    ],
    "text": "I. M. SENANAYAKA, Divisional Secretary, Walapane. Divisional Secretariat, Walapane, 16th August, 2017.",
